  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support education in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deep poverty in Nepal has a terrible impact on children. Many kids go to school barefoot, holding their books in hands or in plastic bags.  FOH will help 250 children in rural Ramechhap, Nepal, by providing them with school uniforms, shoes, sweatshirts, school bags and basic school supplies.  Let&apos;s make education a Way Out of poverty!</narrative>
  </description>
